      "value": "Interestingly enough there was a recent update mentioning security checks where VRChat is trying to tune automation to try and differentiate between crashers and lazy/overly ambitious quest ports.\n\nI think they need to lay down a limit, 318k polys and 37 materials on quest? Too many",
